  "reading": {
    "zh": "全都是 P/Invoke 声明与薄封装，不含业务判断：枚举与读取窗口信息、查状态与矩形、取像、聚焦与层级、专项查询、输入 API；右下的钩子层负责全局键鼠观察（录制用）。",
    "en": "Pure P/Invoke declarations and thin wrappers, no business judgement: enumerate and read windows, query state and geometry, capture pixels, foreground and layer calls, specialised queries, input APIs - plus the hook layer that observes global input for recording."
